            <div xml:id="d60">

                <pb facs="0166" n="64" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg64"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/5749a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China
                        (Johnson)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-13T19:00:00-05:00">January 13, 1933—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13. Please report the date and the important provisions of any agreement now in
                    effect between the Boxer Protocol powers in reference to occupation by them of
                    points listed in Boxer Protocol, Article 9, indicating what points may,
                    according to any such agreement, be occupied by each power. If necessary,
                    consult Tientsin.</p>
                <p>Department is giving consideration to your telegrams relating to problems in this
                    connection.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
